# The comparison ROMs are kept outside the repository. They are not distributed
# (config/PUBLIC_FILES.txt does not list this directory), so committing them
# would add several megabytes to the history for no distribution benefit.
# Rebuild them with build.py --variant a/b/c/reference/reference-packets.
# roms.json and results*/provenance.json still pin the hashes the published
# measurements were taken on, so a rebuild can be checked against them.
